bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CazadorsPalace_Ballroom_DeadGuest_003+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CazadorsPalace_Ballroom_DeadGuest_003+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>01d1f09b-0ae7-4b5d-a6e0-d393dc1482c2</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:01d1f09b-0ae7-4b5d-a6e0-d393dc1482c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:01d1f09b-0ae7-4b5d-a6e0-d393dc1482c2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Dwarf_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Dwarf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Dwarf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Callira</b> is a deceased <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">dwarven</a> musician who was enticed to attend and play a ball at <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Callira's corpse is inside the closed room north west of the ballroom in the Szarr Palace. Reading the note <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ballroom_Invitation\" title=\"Ballroom Invitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ballroom_Invitation\" title=\"Ballroom Invitation\">Ballroom Invitation</a> on it reveals she was invited to play by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Antwun_Dufay\" title=\"Antwun Dufay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png/25px-Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png/38px-Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png/50px-Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chamberlain Dufay\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png/25px-Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Antwun_Dufay.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Antwun_Dufay\" title=\"Antwun Dufay\">Chamberlain Dufay</a>, who in turn brought her friend <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanseverina\" title=\"Sanseverina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/25px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/38px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/50px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanseverina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/25px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanseverina\" title=\"Sanseverina\">Sanseverina</a>, not realizing that the ball was a vampire trap.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ballroom_Invitation\" title=\"Ballroom Invitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ballroom_Invitation\" title=\"Ballroom Invitation\">Ballroom Invitation</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ll_Get_You_In\" title=\"I'll Get You In\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ll_Get_You_In\" title=\"I'll Get You In\">I'll Get You In</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-hori